</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.7.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.8pt;padding-right:2.8pt;"><span id="S4.T2.7.3.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">68.7</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.7.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.8pt;padding-right:2.8pt;"><span id="S4.T2.7.3.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">76.7</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.7.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.8pt;padding-right:2.8pt;"><span id="S4.T2.7.3.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">78.2</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.7.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.8pt;padding-right:2.8pt;"><span id="S4.T2.7.3.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">26.0</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.7.3.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.8pt;padding-right:2.8pt;"><span id="S4.T2.7.3.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">32.4</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.7.3.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.8pt;padding-right:2.8pt;"><span id="S4.T2.7.3.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">36.2</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.7.3.8" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:2.8pt;padding-right:2.8pt;"><span id="S4.T2.7.3.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">20.7</span></td>
